Wah. Astaga.

61
00:06:49,742 --> 00:06:51,536
- Suasanya berubah.
- Modern.

62
00:06:51,619 --> 00:06:55,289
Kita sudah jauh dari mode kadal iguana.

63
00:06:55,456 --> 00:06:59,252
Kau pernah tahu berapa banyak kadal
di dapur Stewart?

64
00:06:59,752 --> 00:07:01,212
Sangat banyak.

65
00:07:01,295 --> 00:07:02,463
Tapi jika kau tahu ayahku,

66
00:07:02,547 --> 00:07:05,508
kau tahu jika dia diizinkan
mendekorasi ruang tamu,

67
00:07:05,591 --> 00:07:07,301
